    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i've tried. but that's the thing, it's like i'm just a ghost. i walk around and people look right through me. even when i'm in a room with them, the connection is just... gone. it's like the version of me they knew died or something. how am i supposed to \"connect\" when the person they'd actually want to talk to isn't even there anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
